notes:        Original work, written by packaging/macos/dmg/atelier-background.py in Atelier's colours. The EffectCraft app icon (assets/app-icon/effectcraft.svg) is referenced via <image>, not copied. Used for the Finder window of the macOS DMG; packaging/macos/package.sh renders it to a TIFF at package time. Text is outlined Archivo/Geist Mono glyph paths (both SIL OFL 1.1); no font file is in this repository.
